{
  "info": {
    "title": "PINNeAPPle Engineering API",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "PINNeAPPle Engineering Cloud API. An engineering requirement in plain language is structured, matched against the\n**Capability Registry** (built by introspecting the PINNeAPPle library), validated, executed in a limited sandbox and\nreturned with an **evidence record** (parameters, versions, logs, resources, files, verifications).\n\nAuthentication: send your key in the `X-API-Key` header. Every call that creates work counts against the key's\nquota (jobs per 24 h, jobs in flight).\n\n```bash\nexport PEA=https://engineering.pinneapple.org PEA_KEY=pea_...\ncurl -s -X POST $PEA/v1/agent/requests -H \"X-API-Key: $PEA_KEY\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"text\": \"60 W MOSFET module on an aluminium finned heat sink, air at 35 °C and 3 m/s, keep it below 85 °C\"}'\ncurl -s $PEA/v1/jobs/<job_id> -H \"X-API-Key: $PEA_KEY\"\ncurl -s $PEA/v1/jobs/<job_id>/result -H \"X-API-Key: $PEA_KEY\"\n```\n\n```python\nimport httpx, time\nc = httpx.Client(base_url=\"https://engineering.pinneapple.org\", headers={\"X-API-Key\": \"pea_...\"})\nr = c.post(\"/v1/agent/requests\", json={\"text\": \"60 W module, finned heat sink, air 35 °C at 3 m/s, limit 85 °C\"}).json()\nwhile c.get(f\"/v1/jobs/{r['job_id']}\").json()[\"status\"] in (\"queued\", \"running\"):\n    time.sleep(2)\nprint(c.get(f\"/v1/jobs/{r['job_id']}/result\").json()[\"report_markdown\"])\n```"
  },
